   "text": "<p>Greater Safety and Efficiency<br/>Through Simple Tool Data Management</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/de/de/shop/zidcode\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Buy Now</a></p>",
