    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/7/csm_zidCode_slider_1af9b576c4.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<h2>»»zidCode««</h2> <p class=\"large-text\"><strong>For manufacturing facilities without their own network. A quick start to the digital and error-free transfer of tool data.</strong></p> <p class=\"large-text\">With »»zidCode««, key success factors will be available quickly. You’ll gain safety, save time, and make it easier for your employees to transfer data to the machine.</p>",
     "right": false,
     "quote": false,
     "dark": false
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/8/b/csm_zidCode4_slider_e9ce590696.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<h2>»»zidCode« 4.0«</h2> <p class=\"large-text\"><strong>For manufacturing operations with their own network. Opens up additional options for greater efficiency with your tool data.</strong></p> <p class=\"large-text\">With »»zidCode 4.0««, you lay the foundation for using other ZOLLER software tools to gain a precise picture of tool performance in your production—even in real time. This increases transparency and process reliability in tool planning.</p>",
     "right": false,
     "quote": false,
     "dark": false
    }
