  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Efficient Tool Handling </h2>",
   "body": "<p>With ZOLLER, you can use your tool data consistently throughout the entire process, from work planning to the CNC machine. You’ll improve efficiency in tool handling, integrate subprocesses, and enhance process reliability through automated data transfer. Digitize your manufacturing with ZOLLER’s TMS Tool Management Solutions: interfaces, software, tool identification, and data transfer with »zidCode 4.0«.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/products/tool-management/data-transfer/zidcode/software-integration\">Learn more about Software &amp; Integration</a></p>",
