   "header": "<h2> Services – First-Class Across the Board </h2>",
   "body": "<p>By purchasing ZOLLER »zidCode« or »zidCode 4.0«, you have made a sound investment. With ZOLLER’s service and our training programs, we ensure that you get the most out of your tool identification system. You can always count on our quick response times.</p>",
